        "jsCode": "// Clone items to avoid mutation\nconst items = [...$input.all()];\n\n// Fisher-Yates shuffle (true randomness)\nfor (let i = items.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n  const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n  [items[i], items[j]] = [items[j], items[i]];\n}\n\nreturn items;"
